About Magic combination :
You obtain automatically the sigils during the move.
Water -> Fire -> Earth -> Atmosphere.
Thus, you obtain the last one at the end of the move.
There is also a "deadly rave" system, that increases the damage
of each hit if the command is successfully inputed.
A successful input is shown with a pentagram
(like in normal sigil obtention)
The input windows are when Itsuwa is readying up her hit.
The inputs are the following:
Water									_D_DF_F^HK / _D_DF_F^C
Fire									_D_DB_B^HK / _D_DB_B^C
Earth									_D_DF_F_UF^HK / _D_DF_F_UF^C
Atmosphere								_F_D_DF^HK / _F_D_DF^C

About Saint Destroyer :
You obtain Zensen while performing Saint Destroyer.
If you've inputed every input of the "deadly rave" succesfully
you get:
_`super sigil version of Zensen
_`increased damage on Saint Destroyer.
If your opponent is a Saint, the Saint Destroyer does more damage.


